quirements while retaining Module 01 NO-GO. It adds bounded test-only H2/HPACK attribution, adversarial observer controls, maintained ingress boundary analysis, and fresh Module 00/02/03 regression and dependency evidence.\n\nThe original 75-case corpus and 23-probe expectations/evaluators remain unchanged. Envoy remains 69/75; supplemental probes remain 16/23; the nine-byte H2 SETTINGS ACK observation still fails the current aggregate zero-byte gate. No runtime candidate, private codec fork, Module 04 work, upstream publication or production activation is included. Actual human architecture/security owners and approval references remain PENDING.\n\nIndependent component reviews accept the scoped documentation, upstream proof, observer diagnostics and corrected regression evidence. Failed collector/scanner/cleanup-review attempts remain explicitly ineligible with safe provenance; flagged telemetry content is excluded from publishable ancestry without scanner suppression. Final integration review and exact local/hosted receipts are linked in `docs/reports/sprint04c-completion.md` and subsequent closeout evidence.\n\nValidation: full fixture-locked `make check`, `make security-scan`, resource/private-fixture cleanup, immutable-source and manifest verification, independent security review, and exact-head hosted `foundation-quality` / `supply-chain-security` are required before merge. Module 04-12 stay LOCKED and production stays BLOCKED.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-14T09:52:26Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:09:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f53ac7852ed367831dc8f70d3863635935185234","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"tiecont:sprint/04c-integration","ref":"sprint/04c-integration","repo":{"id":1453440396,"node_id":"R_kgDOVqG9jA","name":"aegis-gate","full_name":"tiecont/aegis-gate","owner":{"login":"tiecont","id":119944305,"node_id":"U_k